@startuml dev-architecture
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"

title Dev Architecture (WSL2 + Docker Compose + devcontainer option)

node "Windows" as win {
  [Visual Studio Code] as vsc
  node "WSL2 (Ubuntu)" as wsl {
    [Docker Engine] as docker
    folder "Workspace (Git)" as repo

    rectangle "docker compose network" as net {
      [frontend\nNuxt dev server] as fe
      [bff\nSpring Boot (Kotlin)\nDevTools] as bff
      [backend\nSpring Boot (Kotlin)\nDevTools] as be
      database "postgres\n(PostgreSQL)" as db
      [pgAdmin\n(optional)] as pg
    }
  }
}

vsc --> repo : edit / debug
docker --> net : run containers
fe --> bff : /api (dev)
bff --> be : internal REST
be --> db : SQL 5432
pg --> db : optional admin

note right of vsc
.devcontainer:
- 開発ツール(JDK/Node/Gradle)を
  devcontainer に内包
end note

@enduml